[3.575,"o","\r\n"]
[3.575,"o","# Retrieval practice and exam anxiety\r\n"]
[3.645,"o","\r\n"]
[3.715,"o","Retrieval practice means testing yourself instead of rereading. In a controlled trial with 96 first-year students, low-stakes weekly quizzes reduced self-reported exam anxiety and raised the median grade by half a point on a ten-point scale.\r\n"]
[3.785,"o","\r\n"]
[3.855,"o","The authors caution that the trial ran in a single department and that students were not randomly assigned to sections, so the causal claim is tentative.\r\n"]
[3.925,"o","\r\n"]
[3.995,"o","Quizzes that gave immediate feedback worked better than quizzes marked a week later.\r\n"]
