[45.386,"o","\r\n"]
[45.386,"o","## Review methods\r\n"]
[45.456,"o","\r\n"]
[45.526,"o","Spaced review raised final exam scores by 14 percent [@lindgren2019]. Weekly low-stakes quizzes lowered exam anxiety [@okafor2021]. Spaced review also doubled the retention of open-ended problem solving [@lindgren2019].\r\n"]
[45.596,"o","\r\n"]
[45.666,"o","Handwriting always beats typing for every kind of lecture [@moreau2018]. The method is used widely in schools [@vance2020].\r\n"]
